    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se þe þǽs lag abréce, beo þæt órdal on him forad, and gilde þan cyninge CXX scill. to wíte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone breaks these rules, the ordeal shall in his case be invalidated, and he shall pay a fine of 120 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 se þe þǽs lage abréce, beo þæt órdal on him forad, 7 gilde þam cyninge CXX scill' to wíte.</ab>
      </div>
